                             *   Sequence: D is not allowed at                  
                             start? \\"Go down to stair i-1 (cannot             
                             be used consecutively or on stair                  
                             0)\\".\\n                        *   If            
                             we start at 1, can we go Down                      
                             immediately? $1-1=0$. Then we are at 0.            
                             The rule says \\"cannot be used ... on             
