                             $\\\\binom{2}{2}=1$.\\n    *   Maybe               
                             $U=2$? $D=4$. Slots=3. Impossible.\\n              
                             *   Is there a case where we reach 0,              
                             go up, come back?\\n    *   Wait, the              
