                             gives 1 way (D U D).\\n    *   Total =             
                             2.\\n    *   Matches                               
                             `count_ways_to_stair(0) == 2`.\\n\\n*              
                             **Refined Formula**:\\n    For a given             
                             $k$:\\n    Iterate $U$ starting from               
                             0.\\n    Calculate required $D = 2^U -             
                             k$.\\n    If $D < 0$, continue (since              
