                             check on the large test                            
                             cases.\\n`candidate(134217726) ==                  
                             378`.\\n$134217726 = 2^{27} -                      
                             2$.\\n$U=27, D=2$. $\\\\binom{28}{2} =             
                             378$. Correct.\\n`candidate(1073741816)            
